    ,('Accelerator for Systemic Risk Assessment', 'ASRA', 'United Nations Foundation', 'https://www.asranetwork.org/', 'https://www.asranetwork.org/who-we-are', NULL, NULL, '2024-04-11', 'day', 'https://www.asranetwork.org/news/asra-official-launch', 'https://www.asranetwork.org/ https://www.asranetwork.org/who-we-are https://www.asranetwork.org/about https://www.linkedin.com/company/asra-network/ https://www.instagram.com/asranetwork/ https://www.youtube.com/@ASRANetworkChannel', 'Accelerator for Systemic Risk Assessment (ASRA) is a nonprofit initiative hosted by the United Nations Foundation. It develops practical tools and a global network to mainstream systemic risk assessment in policy and decision-making. Its work addresses interconnected risks affecting humanity and ecological systems. ASRA announced in 2026 that it had entered a structured two-year transition to hand over its work.', NULL, NULL, 'asranetwork', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ASRANetworkChannel')
